# This project uses pnpm exclusively; a stray package-lock.json makes EAS run
# `npm ci` (which then fails on an out-of-sync lockfile). Never commit it.
package-lock.json

# fastlane
#
# Our store screenshots are NOT app-captured throwaways — they are curated
# marketing assets generated from the Claude Design "Store Assets" doc, so we
# deliberately DO commit fastlane/screenshots and fastlane/metadata (see
# fastlane/README.md). Only fastlane's transient run output is ignored.

**/fastlane/report.xml
**/fastlane/Preview.html
**/fastlane/test_output
fastlane/*.html

# fastlane credentials (never commit these)
fastlane/*.p8
fastlane/api_key.json
fastlane/*.json.enc

